.TH QUIPU-MEMORY-EXPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-memory\-export \- Export an owner\*(Aqs memory files as a file\-data envelope
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu memory export\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIowner.json\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export an owner\*(Aqs memory files as a file\-data envelope
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIowner.json\fR>

